# Frontend

- Use react-query for server state and zustand only for UI shell state.
- API access goes through `src/api/client.ts`.
- Keep pages thin; reusable pieces under `src/components/`.
- Add Vitest coverage for pure helpers and critical client logic.
- Match existing visual language in `src/index.css` (studio, not generic admin dashboard).
